        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Benjamin Wills Newton, John Nelson Darby, the founder of the Exclusive Brethren\n- Organizations: Plymouth Brethren, Exclusive Brethren\n- Places: Scotland\n- Concepts: supernatural gifts of the Holy Spirit, investigation\n\nFacts:\n- The Plymouth Brethren sent a second person named Benjamin Wills Newton to Scotland to investigate an outbreak of supernatural gifts of the Holy Spirit.\n- Benjamin Wills Newton was distinct from the founder of the Exclusive Brethren.\n- John Nelson Darby was the founder of the Exclusive Brethren.",
